{"step_index":1704,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:00:55Z","input_tokens":2561,"cache_read_tokens":180777,"output_tokens":1677,"content":"We completed the verification of all three components against live disk structures, mount points, and script logic:\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n#### 1. The 6 Subvolumes in the Seed Rootfs: **VERIFIED**\nWe mounted partition 1 (`3tched-base`, UUID `6231f275-effd-4b6d-9ff7-e841531556b7`) and inspected the subvolume B-tree (`btrfs subvolume list`):\n* **ID 256**: `@` (rootfs baseline)\n* **ID 257**: `@agent_memory`\n* **ID 258**: `@agent_rules`\n* **ID 259**: `@agent_shared`\n* **ID 260**: `@agent_skills`\n* **ID 261**: `@agent_soul`\n* **ID 262**: `@agent_user`\n\nThe seed contains exactly the 7 canonical flat subvolumes without any nested or extra members.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Upgrade Subvolume Transfer (`btrfs send / receive`): **VERIFIED**\n* **Pairing Receipt**: In `/var/lib/incus/storage-pools/3tched/.provisioning/3tchedCtlChatbot.upgrade.json`:\n  * `phase`: `\"paired\"`\n  * `host_fsid`: `7de8757c-6b8e-43d0-82fc-47e9da564775`\n  * `replica_fsid`: `46cb26f8-fc1f-4548-9238-800b6ae682cf`\n  * `direction`: `\"host-to-container\"`\n* **Boot Transfer Path** (`sync-instance-upgrade.sh`):\n  * Takes a read-only snapshot of the host upgrade tree (`btrfs subvolume snapshot -r \"$host/@\"`).\n  * Streams it via `btrfs send | btrfs receive` directly into the container's upgrade partition.\n  * Rotates the generation into `$replica/@`.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. OverlayFS Assembly: **VERIFIED**\nThe boot script (